flowchart LR
    Start([CheckpointerMain Loop]) --> ClearLatch[Reset Latch]
    ClearLatch --> AbsorbSync[AbsorbSyncRequests]
    AbsorbSync --> HandleInt[HandleCheckpointerInterrupts]

    HandleInt --> CheckFlags{Check ckpt_flags<br/>in shared memory}
    CheckFlags -->|"flags != 0"| SetReq[Set do_checkpoint = true<br/>chkpt_or_rstpt_requested = true]
    CheckFlags -->|"flags == 0"| CheckTime{elapsed_secs >=<br/>CheckPointTimeout?}

    CheckTime -->|Yes| SetTime[Set do_checkpoint = true<br/>flags |= CHECKPOINT_CAUSE_TIME<br/>chkpt_or_rstpt_timed = true]
    CheckTime -->|No| NoCheckpoint[No checkpoint needed]

    SetReq --> DetermineType{RecoveryInProgress?}
    SetTime --> DetermineType

    DetermineType -->|Yes| RestartPoint[do_restartpoint = true]
    DetermineType -->|No| RegularCP[do_restartpoint = false]

    RestartPoint --> CheckEndRecovery{flags &<br/>CHECKPOINT_END_OF_RECOVERY?}
    CheckEndRecovery -->|Yes| RegularCP
    CheckEndRecovery -->|No| ExecuteRestart[CreateRestartPoint]

    RegularCP --> AcquireLock[SpinLockAcquire ckpt_lck]
    AcquireLock --> FetchFlags[flags |= CheckpointerShmem->ckpt_flags<br/>Clear ckpt_flags<br/>Increment ckpt_started]
    FetchFlags --> ReleaseLock[SpinLockRelease ckpt_lck]
    ReleaseLock --> BroadcastStart[ConditionVariableBroadcast start_cv]

    BroadcastStart --> CheckWarning{Too frequent?<br/>CHECKPOINT_CAUSE_XLOG &&<br/>elapsed_secs < CheckPointWarning}
    CheckWarning -->|Yes| LogWarning[Log frequency warning]
    CheckWarning -->|No| InitVars[Initialize checkpoint variables]
    LogWarning --> InitVars

    InitVars --> ExecuteCP[CreateCheckPoint]
    ExecuteRestart --> CleanupSMGR[smgrdestroyall]
    ExecuteCP --> CleanupSMGR

    CleanupSMGR --> UpdateStats[Update checkpoint statistics]
    UpdateStats --> SignalComplete[Signal checkpoint completion<br/>via condition variables]
    SignalComplete --> CheckArchive[CheckArchiveTimeout]

    NoCheckpoint --> CheckArchive
    CheckArchive --> CheckMoreFlags{More ckpt_flags<br/>set during processing?}
    CheckMoreFlags -->|Yes| ClearLatch
    CheckMoreFlags -->|No| SleepCalc[Calculate sleep timeout]

    SleepCalc --> WaitLatch[WaitLatch with timeout]
    WaitLatch --> ClearLatch

    %% Flag Types
    subgraph "Checkpoint Request Flags"
        F1[CHECKPOINT_IS_SHUTDOWN]
        F2[CHECKPOINT_END_OF_RECOVERY]
        F3[CHECKPOINT_IMMEDIATE]
        F4[CHECKPOINT_FORCE]
        F5[CHECKPOINT_WAIT]
        F6[CHECKPOINT_CAUSE_XLOG]
        F7[CHECKPOINT_CAUSE_TIME]
    end

    %% Styles
    classDef decision fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#d6b656,stroke-width:2px
    classDef action fill:#d5e8d4,stroke:#82b366,stroke-width:2px
    classDef critical fill:#f8cecc,stroke:#b85450,stroke-width:2px
    classDef loop fill:#e1d5e7,stroke:#9673a6,stroke-width:2px

    class CheckFlags,CheckTime,DetermineType,CheckEndRecovery,CheckWarning,CheckMoreFlags decision
    class SetReq,SetTime,AcquireLock,FetchFlags,ExecuteCP,ExecuteRestart action
    class LogWarning,SignalComplete critical
    class Start,ClearLatch,WaitLatch loop